      "body": "## Motivation\n\nWhen a request's Mamba state hits on host (HiCache load-back, the external linker, LMCache), `req.mamba_host_hit_length` is 1 and the load-back fills two Mamba slots: the node's and the request's own. `PrefillAdder` charged only the request's slot, and `budget_state` only checks that at least one slot remains, so a host-hit request could be admitted with a single Mamba slot left.\n\n## Modifications\n\n- `_mamba_gap_budget_for_req` also charges the host-hit node slot. It is charged only while the request holds no state yet: a chunked continuation keeps its stale `mamba_host_hit_length`, but its hit was already loaded.\n- `_update_prefill_budget` debits `rem_mamba_slots` by the slots charged, not by a fixed 1.\n- `add_one_req` returns `NO_TOKEN` when the request needs more Mamba slots than remain.\n\n## Tests\n\nNo new test. On H200:\n\n- `TestUnifiedHybridHiCacheBitExact` (Inkling, Mamba host hits): kl_divs 0.0 x 9.\n- Unit tests (`unit/mem_cache` HiCache suites, `unit/dllm/test_gemma4_uniform_lifecycle.py`, `unit/managers`) match main. `test_mm_process_config` fails on main too. `test_load_snapshot_backends::test_read_returns_latest` failed once and passed on 3 reruns.\n\n<!-- pr-states:start -->\n---\n### CI States\n\nLatest PR Test (Base): <!-- slot:pr-test:start -->:x: [Run #37814327945](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/37814327945)<!-- slot:pr-test:end -->\nLatest PR Test (Extra): <!-- slot:pr-test-extra:start -->:x: [Run #37814327530](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/37814327530)<!-- slot:pr-test-extra:end -->\nLatest PR Test (AMD ROCm 10): <!-- slot:pr-test-amd:start -->:x: [Run #37814329306](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/37814329306)<!-- slot:pr-test-amd:end -->\n<!-- pr-states:end -->",
